      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please see me comment / attempt to use this https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/keystone/+/885463/comments/a7e91ece_77e3d924.\n\nCould you kindly tell me if I should be able to apply this patch on master and then run \n\n  tox --notest -r -e py38\n  source .tox/py38/bin/activate\n  alembic -c keystone/common/sql/alembic.ini upgrade heads\n  alembic -c keystone/common/sql/alembic.ini revision --autogenerate\n\nwith no new revision being created?\nOr am I holding this wrong?",
      "revId": "1bcf8cee0d93c2844b810fa30c2e3d9ba99e813e",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
